// %run rebuilding the REPL buffer runs its main when the buffer defines main
// and no entry calls it, as %run runs a file's, argv[0] the buffer's name
// (owner 2026-10-12). A buffer that calls main runs it once, in the replay.
// `runs` counts: the final line reads 1, not 2. madc ran no main.
int base = 1;
